        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We cooperated with third-party logistics service providers whose primary responsibility was to provide cross-border logistics services, typically by sea, for the delivery of our automobiles to our PRC customers.",
